# Native build artifacts that bake absolute host paths from the
# developer's machine (CocoaPods xcconfig, Pods.xcodeproj, Gradle wrapper,
# Xcode DerivedData). EAS Cloud regenerates these via `pod install` /
# Gradle and must not see the local copies. When .easignore exists, EAS
# does NOT fall back to .gitignore, so these patterns must live here too.
**/Pods/
**/ios/build/
**/DerivedData/
**/android/build/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/app/build/
